# Short notification candidates for the Inkplate buzzer probe.
#
# One RTTTL score per line; blank lines and `#` comments are skipped.
# These are listening candidates, NOT acoustically selected presets.
# Regenerate the firmware module after any change; see
# docs/guides/audio/buzzer-listening.md for the exact command.
#
# Timing is literal: adjacent notes sound continuously (only SetCode), so
# every motif carries `p` rests between notes for separate beeps.
ack:d=16,o=6,b=120:c,32p,e
attention:d=16,o=6,b=120:e,32p,e
complete:d=16,o=6,b=120:c,32p,e,32p,g
